# Product Git

**This file + ADR 003** are the only places that compare portfolio `main` vs sellable `product`. Other product rules describe the SaaS line only.

| Branch      | Use                  | Data          |
| ----------- | -------------------- | ------------- |
| `main`      | Portfolio demo       | `MONGO_URI`   |
| `product`   | Sellable SaaS        | `POSTGRES_URL` (shared, multi-tenant) |
| `feature/*` | → merge to `product` |               |

**Avoid:** product code reading `MONGO_URI`; sharing PG dev DB with production data; force-push; merging whole `product` ↔ `main` (cherry-pick shared fixes only).

Tenancy model: **ADR 005** — implement on `feature/*`, merge into `product`.
